# ===========================================================================
# ROOT .gitignore — global/OS only + the one cross-cutting SECURITY boundary.
# Each package keeps its own .gitignore for build outputs etc.
# ===========================================================================

# OS / editor / session
.DS_Store
.claude/
.venv/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SECURITY BOUNDARY (defense-in-depth; packages/data also self-ignores):
# Sony firmware IP, decompiler output, NAND/device backups, device dumps,
# firmware-derived assets, personal/device data — NEVER committed (repo is public).
# Only packages/data/README.md (+ its .gitignore) is tracked; all contents ignored.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
packages/data/*
!packages/data/README.md
!packages/data/.gitignore
